{
  "id": "6a8c1a68f4ece9fcff0d92a1",
  "title": "井戸端米部",
  "created": 1787566822,
  "updated": 1787573398,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a8c1a68f4ece9fcff0d92a1",
      "text": "井戸端米部",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566822,
      "updated": 1787566822
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1ae60000000000d10f90",
      "text": "　お米の情報を交換しよう！[joniel.icon]",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566822,
      "updated": 1787566836
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1ae60000000000d10f91",
      "text": "　　毎日食べるから美味しい方がうれしいため",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566823,
      "updated": 1787567838
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1af40000000000d10f92",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566837,
      "updated": 1787566837
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c20ac0000000000eaad08",
      "text": "[コシヒカリ]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787568301,
      "updated": 1787568310
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c20e90000000000eaad09",
      "text": " [コシヒカリBL]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787568361,
      "updated": 1787568374
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1b020000000000d10f93",
      "text": "[五百川]",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566851,
      "updated": 1787566861
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1b0f0000000000d10f95",
      "text": "[青天の霹靂]",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566864,
      "updated": 1787566871
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1b2d0000000000c0c9ad",
      "text": "[いちほまれ]",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566894,
      "updated": 1787566904
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1b380000000000c0c9ae",
      "text": "[華越前]",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566905,
      "updated": 1787566910
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1c130000000000920efb",
      "text": "[はえぬき]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787567125,
      "updated": 1787573215
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c33db0000000000cd3677",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787573211,
      "updated": 1787573211
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1d5900000000003f4320",
      "text": "[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1787567450,
      "updated": 1787567450
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1c140000000000920efc",
      "text": "\tコメ何かえば いいのか全然わからん…1年くらい前いつも買ってた雑穀入のやつがスーパーからなくなってて途方に暮れて　手ぶらで帰った",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1787567125,
      "updated": 1787567449
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1de20000000000920efe",
      "text": "\t 買うサイクルが長めで新米がうますぎるので普段食べるお米を選ぶのが難しい...[joniel.icon]",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787567587,
      "updated": 1787567644
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1d5800000000003f431d",
      "text": " [令和の米騒動]、とかやってたのもう1年以上前か",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787567449,
      "updated": 1787568733
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1d5800000000003f431e",
      "text": "\t家でお米食べる習慣なくなってるな",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1787567449,
      "updated": 1787567449
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1b070000000000d10f94",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566855,
      "updated": 1787566855
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c33f80000000000cd3679",
      "text": "[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787573240,
      "updated": 1787573242
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c33fa0000000000cd367b",
      "text": " メイドさんが育てたお米を買ったことがある",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787573243,
      "updated": 1787573258
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c34910000000000cd367c",
      "text": "  はえぬきだった",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787573393,
      "updated": 1787573398
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c33fa0000000000cd367a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787573242,
      "updated": 1787573242
    }
  ]
}